      "id": "q002",
      "domain": "technical",
      "group_id": "technical-documentation",
      "success": true,
      "answer": {
        "answerable": true,
        "answer": "BoundedSemaphore 是 Semaphore 的一个版本，区别在于：普通 Semaphore 允许 release() 调用次数多于 acquire() 调用次数；而 BoundedSemaphore 在 release() 使内部计数器超过初始 value 时会抛出 ValueError。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "text": "普通 Semaphore 允许 release() 次数多于 acquire() 次数。",
            "source_id": "SOURCE_1",
            "evidence_quote": "Unlike\nBoundedSemaphore\n,\nSemaphore\nallows\nmaking more\nrelease()\ncalls than\nacquire()\ncalls.",
            "url": "https://docs.python.org/3/library/asyncio-sync.html"
          },
          {
            "text": "BoundedSemaphore 在 release() 使内部计数器超过初始 value 时抛出 ValueError。",
            "source_id": "SOURCE_1",
            "evidence_quote": "Bounded Semaphore is a version of\nSemaphore\nthat raises\na\nValueError\nin\nrelease()\nif it\nincreases the internal counter above the initial\nvalue\n.",
            "url": "https://docs.python.org/3/library/asyncio-sync.html"
          }
        ],
        "limitations": "资料仅涵盖 asyncio 中的 Semaphore 与 BoundedSemaphore，未涉及其他实现或线程版本。",
        "verified_citations": 2
      },
      "citation_count": 2,
      "verified_count": 2
